            ₹80,000/year. Academic classes range from ₹15,000 to ₹35,000/year. Scholarships are available for
            meritorious students.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item "><button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="d-flex align-items-start gap-2"><span class="faq-badge badge bg-warning text-dark rounded-circle d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">6</span><span style="font-size:14px">Is there any
