      </div>
      <div class="faq-item "><button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="d-flex align-items-start gap-2"><span class="faq-badge badge bg-warning text-dark rounded-circle d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">7</span><span style="font-size:14px">What kind of study
